  "executive_briefing": "The late 2026 intelligence landscape is dominated by the legislative failure of the CLARITY Act in the U.S. Senate, which failed to achieve the necessary threshold for passage and shifted the regulatory burden onto independent federal and state agency enforcement. Concurrently, institutional Bitcoin adoption has matured past initial speculative ETF hype into a structured corporate treasury reserve and rebalancing model. On the technological front, native programmability via decidable languages like Clarity is challenging EVM dominance by offering deterministic security for Bitcoin assets, while trust-minimized, non-custodial liquidity abstraction continues to bridge Bitcoin and Ethereum ecosystems without traditional custodial risks.",
